    "parsing_res_list": [
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(a)工作职责及工作内容交接：包括但不限于陈述工作内容、正在处理工作/项目的进展、客户关系、向甲方交还载有甲方技术秘密或商业秘密的文件及资料、档案、信息系统权限等。该等工作交接均应具有详细的书面材料说明，使交接后的工作能顺利进行。\n",
            "block_bbox": [
                156,
                19,
                1593,
                162
            ],
            "block_id": 0,
            "block_order": 1
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "The Employee shall transfer his/her work duties and job activities including but not limited to stating thejb activities, the progress of jobs and/or projects at hand and customer relations, and returning files, documents and archives containing technical secrets and/or business secrets of Company and information system authorities. The foregoing transferring shall be recorded in detail in writing for the smooth proceedingof the work later.",
            "block_bbox": [
                163,
                192,
                1590,
                391
            ],
            "block_id": 1,
            "block_order": 2
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(b）接受、配合甲方对乙方工作期间行为进行的必要审计。",
            "block_bbox": [
                170,
                418,
                885,
                449
            ],
            "block_id": 2,
            "block_order": 3
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "The Employee shall accept necessary audits on his/her work during the period of employment and cooperate with Company in the audits.\n",
            "block_bbox": [
                169,
                478,
                1586,
                561
            ],
            "block_id": 3,
            "block_order": 4
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(c）归还相关甲方财产，包括但不限于向甲方归还办公资产、还清借支资金、签署离职承诺书、交还钥匙、出入证件及任何其持有或控制的与甲方业务或事务相关联的财产等。\n",
            "block_bbox": [
                172,
                593,
                1584,
                676
            ],
            "block_id": 4,
            "block_order": 5
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "The Employee shall return related possessions of Company including but not limited to returning the office assets,payingoffbwddvcigmiootys,assndnsis kept or controlled by the Employee that is in connection with the business or affairs of Company.",
            "block_bbox": [
                176,
                705,
                1585,
                846
            ],
            "block_id": 5,
            "block_order": 6
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "14.2因乙方原因未办理或未及时办理工作交接手续，给甲方造成损失的，乙方应予以赔偿。",
            "block_bbox": [
                111,
                884,
                1230,
                913
            ],
            "block_id": 6,
            "block_order": 7
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "The Employee shall indemnify Company for losses, if any, incurred by the Employee's failure to transfer or promptly transfer his/her work.\n",
            "block_bbox": [
                112,
                940,
                1584,
                1022
            ],
            "block_id": 7,
            "block_order": 8
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "14.3甲方应当在解除或者终止本协议后，为乙方出具解除或者终止劳动合同的证明，并在15日内为乙方办理档案、社会保险关系及其本人及家属的户口转移手续，乙方应予以配合。\n",
            "block_bbox": [
                115,
                1059,
                1584,
                1142
            ],
            "block_id": 8,
            "block_order": 9
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Company shall provide related documents to prove the cancellation or termination of the Agreement upon the cancellation or termination of the Agreement and transfer the personal archive documents and social security benefits of the Employee and the household of the Employee and his/her dependents within 15 days. The Employee shall cooperate with Company in the whole process.\n",
            "block_bbox": [
                115,
                1170,
                1585,
                1359
            ],
            "block_id": 9,
            "block_order": 10
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "14.4乙方在工作期间因个人原因给甲方造成经济损失或者乙方按照本协议或双方签订的培训协议等应承担赔偿责任的，乙方同意甲方可以从乙方的离职结算款（包括但不限于分红、奖金、工资、离职经济补偿等）中作相应扣除。",
            "block_bbox": [
                116,
                1395,
                1570,
                1477
            ],
            "block_id": 10,
            "block_order": 11
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "If the Employee causes economic losses of Company due to personal reasons during the period of employment or the Employee is liable for penalties according to this Agreement or the training agreement between the two Parties, the Employee agrees that Company deducts the losses and due penalties from the demission settlement pays (including but not limited to dividends, bonus, salary, and demission compensation).\n",
            "block_bbox": [
                116,
                1505,
                1585,
                1698
            ],
            "block_id": 11,
            "block_order": 12
        },
        {
            "block_label": "paragraph_title",
            "block_content": "15法律责任 Legal Liabilities ",
            "block_bbox": [
                78,
                1755,
                466,
                1789
            ],
            "block_id": 12,
            "block_order": 13
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "若乙方违反本协议第10、11、12条中的任何规定，乙方应赔偿甲方由此而遭受的一切损失，包括甲方的直接经济损失和可预见的经济损失，并承担其他相应的法律责任。\n",
            "block_bbox": [
                114,
                1849,
                1584,
                1933
            ],
            "block_id": 13,
            "block_order": 14
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "legal liabilities.\n\n",
            "block_bbox": [
                107,
                1959,
                1585,
                2094
            ],
            "block_id": 14,
            "block_order": 15
        }
    ],
